"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([[3409],{8528:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"functions":[],"properties":[],"types":[],"name":"DataController","desc":"Bridges the server\'s Profile Replica into [ClientState] and gates the\\nclient boot on it.\\n\\n:::danger The whole client boot blocks here\\n`Entry.client.luau` step 3 waits on this controller before it will\\nbootstrap any other controller, tear down the loading screen, dispatch\\n`READY`, or mount the React app:\\n\\n```lua\\nlocal DataController = require(\\"./Features/Core/Controllers/DataController\\")\\n\\nif not DataController.didLoad then\\n\\tDataController.Loaded:Wait()\\nend\\n```\\n\\nNothing downstream ever has to defend against empty player data \u2014 but by\\nthe same token, if the Profile Replica never arrives the client stops at\\na loading screen. There is no timeout here.\\n:::\\n\\n### What it does\\n\\nAt require time it connects to `Replica.Client.getReplicaAddedSignal(\\"Profile\\", true)`.\\nThe `true` fetches any replica that already exists, so requiring this\\nmodule late still resolves. On the first (and only the first \u2014 later\\nreplicas are ignored) Profile replica:\\n\\n1. `DataController.replica` is set.\\n2. The replica\'s whole `data` table is pushed into `ClientState.playerData`.\\n3. `didLoad` flips true and `Loaded` fires once, releasing the boot gate.\\n4. A `GetKeyChangedSignal` connection is opened for every top-level key in\\n   `DataTemplate(LocalPlayer)`, each writing back into `ClientState.playerData`\\n   through `SetPath`. Keys absent from the template are not mirrored.\\n\\nFrom there the flow is one-way: server writes the profile, the replica\\nreplicates it, this controller mirrors it into `ClientState`, and\\ncomponents read `ClientState`. Nothing here writes to the server \u2014\\nprofile mutations go out as red actions.\\n\\n[StatsController] sits one layer further down, mirroring\\n`playerData.stats` into the scalar `ClientState.coins` / `ClientState.xp`\\nstates.\\n\\nCopyright (c) 2026 firebit. All rights reserved.\\nfirebit/survival-islands - proprietary and confidential.","realm":["Client"],"source":{"line":52,"path":"src/Client/Features/Core/Controllers/DataController.luau"}}')}}]);